<title>USA: Prams New York City GO deal Baa1 by Moody's.</title>
<headline>Prams New York City GO deal Baa1 by Moody's.</headline>
<text>
<p>NEW YORK, Oct 3 - Moody's Investors Service - Rating Announcement As of 10/03/96.</p>
<p>    Issuer		: Prams Series 81 (relating to New York</p>
<p>City G.O. fiscal 1997 Ser. D, due 11-1-09)</p>
<p>    State		 : NY</p>
<p>    Rating		: Baa1</p>
<p>    Sale Amount	 : 6,180,000</p>
<p>Expected Sale Date: 10/07/96</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
